  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Temperatures unavailable after updating.</strong> MacBreeze&#x27;s fan helper has to be reinstalled when the app is replaced, and the app never said so — it just showed nothing. It now tells you clearly, on whatever screen you are looking at, and offers a button to put it right.</li>
<li><strong>Quit did nothing.</strong> Quit and Cmd-Q are now honoured. Closing the window still only hides MacBreeze, which is the point of it living in the menu bar.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
